5,1,1,talk,Minako,,I need to understand the true cost of our current arrangement before we change anything.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’m curious why the silence last month felt heavier than any argument. I want to understand the social friction before we fix the mechanics.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I need to verify the actual condition of the car at handover. If it’s not ready, my morning routine collapses immediately.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I refuse to guess. I need the exact fuel receipts and the recorded hours to see who actually drives.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to know where all the arranging time goes. It feels like it costs more than the fuel.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, your focus on fuel is good, but I worry about the hidden costs. @Benjamin, that social friction is real, but we need data first.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, data is vital, but it won’t capture the awkward silences. I’m looking into what other households did to avoid that specific rot.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, recorded hours are useful, but I need the mechanic’s remarks. If the car is degrading, my morning is ruined regardless of who drives.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the mechanic’s notes are secondary. I need the raw numbers first. If the car is dying, we need to know the cost before we blame the driver.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I agree. The hours are the real drain. I’ll check the diary to see where the arranging time actually goes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, arranging time is a real cost. I will check the tax and insurance papers to see the fixed baseline.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, fixed costs are the floor, not the ceiling. I’ll examine the spell of checking figures to see if that ritual itself breeds resentment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, checking figures is administrative, not social. I will examine the state of the car at handover to see if it is actually drivable.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, resentment is a symptom, not the cause. I will examine the fuel receipts and the recorded hours to establish the baseline.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Asuka, I understand your worry. I will check the diary and the mechanic’s remarks to see if the car’s state causes the extra arranging time.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
