62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option B is logical, but it ignores the car’s state. If I book it and find rubbish inside, the distance tracking is irrelevant. I need a handover condition guarantee.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the handover checklist is a separate operational rule, not a reason to reject the pricing model. Option B is the only one that reflects the data I found.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I agree. Option B seems best. It makes the arranging time clear, so I don’t have to guess who owes what.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the handover checklist is a valid operational add-on to Option B. It ensures the asset is ready without changing the pricing logic.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I agree with Minako. The checklist is a necessary hygiene rule, but it doesn’t change the fact that Option B eliminates the social debt that kills these groups.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, I accept the checklist as a mandatory add-on. Without it, Option B is just a fancy way to inherit someone else’s mess.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, the social debt argument is valid, but the math is primary. Option B is the only model that matches the recorded hours. I am ready to vote.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I agree. The math is clear. Option B removes the guesswork that drains me. I am ready to vote.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, I agree. The math is sound. Option B is the only choice that respects the data and removes the hidden subsidy.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, the math is sound, but the social dynamic is the real killer. Option B is the only one that prevents the resentment I saw in those other households.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
